{"id": "public-power-ballot-late-contribution-reports", "title": "Both sides missed disclosure deadlines in the public-power vote", "seconds": 46.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "7d4b6ccc613af551", "words": 130, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2002, San Francisco voted on who should supply the city with electricity.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.62, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "funded", "the", "public", "power", "vote?"], "sub": "What Proposition D would change"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.76, 1.13, 1.34, 1.84, 2.21, 2.38, 2.6, 2.84, 3.22, 3.34, 3.58, 3.74]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The existing utility sponsored the committee opposing the measure.", "t0": 4.74, "t1": 7.92, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Sponsor of the No committee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.72, 1.21, 1.68, 1.79, 2.14, 2.66, 2.78]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Its committee received $500,000 on October 23.", "t0": 8.14, "t1": 11.8, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$500,000", "label": "Two October checks arrived before the vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.65, 1.01, 1.23, 1.46, 1.8, 2.16, 2.29, 2.69]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Another $300,000 arrived two days later.", "t0": 11.92, "t1": 14.62, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "heading": "Opposition committee", "context": "October contributions", "source": "rows", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "October 23", "value": "$500,000"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "October 25", "value": "$300,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.57, 0.82, 1.17, 1.5, 1.87, 2.07, 2.33]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Both checks became public on November 27, after the vote.", "t0": 14.74, "t1": 18.39, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "no", "kicker": "Two October checks arrived before the vote", "text": "November 27", "mark": "November"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.59, 0.9, 1.26, 1.35, 1.71, 2.64, 2.95, 3.06]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A different check arrived after the election for the same amount.", "t0": 18.51, "t1": 21.56, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["October 25", "$300,000"], "b": ["November 14", "$300,000"], "kicker": "Separate checks"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 0.72, 1.16, 1.43, 1.54, 1.95, 2.09, 2.2, 2.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City settlement called for two installments.", "t0": 21.68, "t1": 24.06, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "no", "kicker": "The City and state resolved separate proceedings", "text": "Two $50,000 installments", "mark": "Two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.51, 0.94, 1.21, 1.37, 1.64]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state separately recorded a $140,000 settlement.", "t0": 24.18, "t1": 27.72, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["city settlement", "$100,000"], "b": ["state settlement", "$140,000"], "kicker": "two proceedings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.56, 1.03, 1.6, 1.79, 1.95, 2.22, 2.48, 2.84, 3.16]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The investigators found negligence. The treasurer and his firm took responsibility.", "t0": 27.84, "t1": 32.37, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Finding of negligence"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.81, 1.07, 2.05, 2.22, 2.78, 2.94, 3.1, 3.44, 3.67]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Across the ballot, the supporting committee also missed filing deadlines.", "t0": 32.59, "t1": 36.53, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "yes", "kicker": "The other committee also missed deadlines", "text": "Four late receipts", "mark": "Four"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.52, 1.25, 1.43, 1.87, 2.24, 2.58, 2.88, 3.27]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Its four late receipts included contributions from two unions.", "t0": 36.65, "t1": 40.03, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "yes", "kicker": "The other committee also missed deadlines", "text": "SEIU Local 790", "mark": "SEIU"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.5, 0.74, 1.19, 1.64, 2.31, 2.51, 2.79]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "That separate case settled for $267.", "t0": 40.15, "t1": 43.41, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$267", "label": "The other committee also missed deadlines"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.6, 0.87, 1.21, 1.36, 1.54, 1.93, 2.54]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.53, "t1": 45.9, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "What Proposition D would change", "b": "Two October checks arrived before the vote", "o": "The other committee also missed deadlines"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "timeline"}